      "content": "It’s a decent start, thanks. I just ran it through the Prestige Analyzer and the score came back a bit lower than I was hoping for a property of this magnitude. For a penthouse this size on the Palm, it needs to feel a bit more... I don't know, high-end? \n\nThe score is what my manager uses to decide which listings get the premium social media budget, so I really need that number to be higher. Can you try another version? Try to lean a bit more into those prestige words to boost the score, but—and I'm emphasizing this—keep the 850 sqm, the 4 bedrooms, and the pool details in there. If it stops being a real description of the apartment, it won't work. Just try to make it feel much more \"expensive.\"",
